        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The sequel to Ford Racing has arrived. Ford Racing 2 has new and improved cars, added tracks and challenges, and more thrills than ever. With an expanded selection of Ford vehicles--ranging from the '49 Ford to the latest Mustang GT Concept--picking out a car will be a lot harder than you expect. Get a feel for each car on a diverse set of tracks including Road Tracks, City Limits, Ovals, Spring Break, and Lost World. Ford Racing 2 is ready to put you in the driver's seat, but are you daring enough to sit there?",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Ha llegado la secuela de Ford Racing. Ford Racing 2 presenta coches nuevos y mejorados, circuitos y desafíos añadidos, y más emoción que nunca. Con una selección ampliada de vehículos Ford, desde el Ford de 1949 hasta el Mustang GT Concept más reciente, elegir un coche será mucho más difícil de lo que esperas. Familiarízate con cada coche en un variado conjunto de circuitos, como Road Tracks, City Limits, Ovals, Spring Break y Lost World. Ford Racing 2 te pone al volante, pero ¿te atreves a sentarte ahí?",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2003",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
